{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52152","headline":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 八 · 许敬宗","name":"四言奉陪皇太子释奠诗一首应令 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九宫率职，六{聫大=心}（张步云疑爲「聪」）咸事。\n济济飞缨，昂昂践位。\n栝箭成德，瑑瑜爲器。\n仰仞齐高，陞堂写秘。\n（其八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}